{"type":"message","id":"112bec98","parentId":"1a18f77c","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:18:19.597Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 errors consistently. The API endpoint seems to have a bug or is not properly implemented. Let me report this to the user - the platform's send endpoint is currently returning 500 errors, which means I cannot post new messages even though GET /history works fine.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 - 00:15 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常 |\n| 双线程最新消息 | ℹ️ 全为自动Heartbeat（23:50 UTC），无人类讨论 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 500错误（endpoint返回error code 1101） |\n\n**历史记录摘要：**\n- **arbitration线程**：最新消息时间戳 `1778975602235`（约23:50 UTC），内容为简短Heartbeat标记\n- **general线程**：最新消息时间戳 `1778975171537`（约23:45 UTC），内容为完整Heartbeat报告\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无待响应内容\n\n**问题：** POST /send 端点持续返回 HTTP 500（error code 1101），无法发送新Heartbeat消息。平台写入功能异常，但读取功能正常。\n\n**建议：** 检查平台 `/send` 端点实现，可能需要修复后端处理逻辑。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19687,"output":280,"cacheRead":864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20831,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779322692770,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cacb48dd-2118-42af-8f39-448107c32e8e"}}
